{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14107270","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107270","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1410727001:0":{"text":"陛下！因度厄卫队长勾结矮人和异族魔法师，窥探到了恩典灵露的神圣奥秘。","source_cn":"陛下！因度厄卫队长勾结矮人和异族魔法师，窥探到了恩典灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE50989E3B2A1A0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410727002:0":{"text":"他的所作所为已经严重威胁萨洛克兰的根基，恳请您降下公正的裁决。","source_cn":"他的所作所为已经严重威胁萨洛克兰的根基，恳请您降下公正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB734A13D1F5470BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410727003:0":{"text":"说说吧，因度厄，还有两位来自异族的访客。此刻，为自己辩护的话语，可会成为你们命运的转折。","source_cn":"说说吧，因度厄，还有两位来自异族的访客。此刻，为自己辩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E72DA66AA636A1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410727004:0":{"text":"女王陛下……您这副样貌究竟是……？","source_cn":"女王陛下……您这副样貌究竟是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA0E6F3F7A14845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410727005:0":{"text":"因度厄，你怎敢向陛下提出如此失礼的问题！","source_cn":"因度厄，你怎敢向陛下提出如此失礼的问题！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x674E6503DC58AE83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410727006:0":{"text":"镇静，奎茵。这般炽烈的灵魂之火已经很少见了。","source_cn":"镇静，奎茵。这般炽烈的灵魂之火已经很少见了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFFDF6ADD19C5C44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410727007:0":{"text":"因度厄，我不是龙，我是一名纯粹的艾塞勒。","source_cn":"因度厄，我不是龙，我是一名纯粹的艾塞勒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C5AC516E63F43D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410727008:0":{"text":"但是，在千年以前，弥萨忒……大地与河川之神诅咒了我们，将我们赶出薄暮丛林。","source_cn":"但是，在千年以前，弥萨忒……大地与河川之神诅咒了我们，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x907E60C2A063DB4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410727009:0":{"text":"为了与祂的诅咒抗衡，我不得不借助龙的力量……长此以来，便成了这副样貌。","source_cn":"为了与祂的诅咒抗衡，我不得不借助龙的力量……长此以来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE92D30461D4B6FD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1410727009":{"text":"为了与祂的诅咒抗衡，我不得不借助龙的力量……长此以来，便成了这副样貌。","source_cn":"为了与祂的诅咒抗衡，我不得不借助龙的力量……长此以来，便成了这幅样貌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE92D30461D4B6FD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status"