了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2C38CB0F07294D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1410727019:0":{"text":"艾塞勒的女王！我的祖先们触怒了龙，因此遭到诅咒，你们又做了哪些触怒神明的事？","source_cn":"艾塞勒的女王！我的祖先们触怒了龙，因此遭到诅咒，你们又...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA68E4BBE299FA1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410727020:0":{"text":"呵，神明，不可捉摸。我们也只是为了保卫生存的家园……","source_cn":"呵，神明，不可捉摸。我们也只是为了保卫生存的家园……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA76EB60142FCE095","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1410727021:0":{"text":"总之，只有利用初始之龙的力量，才能对抗弥萨忒的诅咒，那时的我们别无选择。","source_cn":"总之，只有利用初始之龙的力量，才能对抗弥萨忒的诅咒，那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C5C07B649BA5C01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1410727022:0":{"text":"可是一旦停止饮用龙的蛋清，我们便会异化成可怕的怪物，这何尝不是另外一种诅咒！","source_cn":"可是一旦停止饮用龙的蛋清，我们便会异化成可怕的怪物，这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA28B4E2FA86D93BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1410727023:0":{"text":"为什么要停止呢？初始之龙即便在沉睡时也会不断地产下子嗣，它是多么神奇的生物啊。","source_cn":"为什么要停止呢？初始之龙即便在沉睡时也会不断地产下子嗣...","status":"matched","has